{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-3", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "無解的謎題", "storyInfo": "帕拉斯與卡珊卓拉、理事官里底婭，還有從科林尼亞來的祭司，幾人各懷心思，想要將緹緹推上第一神殿重建工程收尾階段負責人的位置。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g11_firsttemple_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉，自從我一週前被你手下的小祭司瞪了一眼之後，你就再也沒來過我這裡了啊？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "管理恩底彌翁神殿的同時接手第一神殿的重建工作並非易事。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "芙里歐只是擔心我過於操勞，她知道我們還在祭司學院的時候就是朋友了。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以更不能接受我一回來就給你添麻煩？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "半年前，當你放棄了走祭司的通道，像一個等待解夢的普通米諾斯人一樣出現在恩底彌翁神殿時，我就知道我們都遇到了麻煩。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一般的神諭，無論是深夜造訪的夢境還是不期而至的幻覺，大部分英雄的指示都會被歸納為常見的意象。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道，我們上學的時候還專門背過，這樣一來，不具備“天賦”的普通祭司也可以為領受神諭的民眾指引方向。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你帶來的那則神諭，它所呈現的每個細節都不曾記載於任何經典古籍……我確信它是一則強力的啟示，正因如此，它令我非常不安。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，我們會找到解決方法的。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，你不該辭去祭司一職，那樣或許能得到更多幫助……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然後隱瞞自己的病症，繼續當米諾斯邊境傳說中的“勝利女神”嗎？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕這個名字已經被其他同胞繼承，我也應該避免節外生枝。況且眾英雄千里迢迢指引我回來，我必須對自己誠實。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……看來你在羅德島休養的那段時間，過得很好。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然。哦，我是不是沒向你提起過，我在那艘艦船上還組了一個“米諾斯聯盟”？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有這麼多離開家鄉求醫的米諾斯人？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "確實不少。但在我們的聯盟裡，真正的米諾斯人只有埃拉托小姐和火神小姐，其他成員只是在精神上嚮往我們的國度。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等有機會了我一定向你詳細介紹。他們都是滿懷英雄氣概、對詩歌藝術和釀造技術充滿熱情的人！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以你們是個喝酒的聯盟。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈沒錯，不過少了你還是差點意思。雖然你本人不勝酒力，但釀酒的技術是同期祭司中最高明的。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "學院交流大會的時候，你用衣帶綁起典雅的衣袖，像老練的工匠般捶打葡萄的樣子，真是太迷人了！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我看你就是嘴饞了，我給你的秘方呢？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "去阿克羅蒂村的時候就不見了。後來與我同行的薩卡茲護衛教了我卡茲戴爾的釀酒秘法，才終於緩解了我的口舌之苦。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我從不擔心你找不到同伴。先是薩卡茲護衛，現在又跟薩爾貢使節團的大使當了朋友。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你聽說了果農和工匠的事，緹緹很可靠。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹小姐或許很聰明，對米諾斯也沒有敵意，但她的身分依舊敏感。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是我剛剛不打斷你，不光是文物交換儀式的選址，你是不是會把我們原本商量好的戲劇儀式也交給她負責？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "究竟是你太過信任她，還是……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，你的眉頭又皺起來了，卡珊卓拉。是我離開祭司工作太久了，一時不太適應，偶爾偷懶罷了，不用擔心。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯，我知道你從來不是逃避責任的人，不然米諾斯邊境也不會流傳關於你的傳說。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我並不介意替你主導神殿重建的工作，我只是感到可惜，明明你更擅長與人打交道，也深得工匠信賴。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我以為你向民眾發出提議，是希望米諾斯人回歸英雄傳統，重新凝聚精神。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說得沒錯。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但既然如此，由誰主導就更不重要了，不是嗎？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們的同胞崇拜英雄，卻也漸漸忘了米諾斯能有今日重現的繁榮，靠的不僅僅是某幾位英雄。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“英雄本就從民眾中來，不問出身，也不問來由……”", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你我真是心意相通啊。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我理解你的意思……但現在神殿重建工作正在收尾階段，從現實角度來說，也比以往更需要一個統籌的負責人。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用擔心，可能很快就會有這個負責人了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "忘了跟你說，我似乎看到里底婭小姐往神殿廣場的方向過去了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這位從重建神殿之初就隱約與你我不合，甚至不想讓祭司負責戲劇儀式的理事官，會是去做什麼的呢？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "posfrom": "200,0", "posto": "0,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹大使，終於見到您了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請問您是？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是雅賽努斯理事官里底婭，這次兩國文物交換一事的負責人。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭小姐，真是抱歉，到訪雅賽努斯的第一天我本該與您照會，沒想到……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，梅捷緹克緹小姐脫離使節團從古道進入雅賽努斯，想必是為了感受克瑞斯拉初到雅賽努斯的見聞吧。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為什麼要因為太過熱愛米諾斯的文化與史詩，而向一位米諾斯人道歉呢？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再說了，我還要向您致謝。要不是您想出了辦法來解決果農和工匠之間的矛盾，第一神殿的重建進度不會這麼樂觀。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是想做一些力所能及的小事。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "理事官小姐，使節團的貝赫努先生已經跟您接洽過了，我想交換儀式的流程和場地應該還未完全敲定？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，比起在狹小隱密的豪華場所，文物交換儀式是否能在克瑞斯拉雕像低垂的眼眸之下，由雅賽努斯民眾共同見證？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您是說，在第一神殿的廣場舉辦交換儀式？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。您也知道，為了交換三城建設時期薩爾貢人遺留在這裡的技術資料，我帶來的是法爾賈萬達巴德博物館最珍貴的館藏。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無數流傳下來的米諾斯英雄故事中都有它的身影，正因為它與英雄克瑞斯拉息息相關。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今日我見到神殿廣場落成的雕像後深受感動，克瑞斯拉英勇的面龐與我帶來的文物更是相得益彰。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且我記得，以米諾斯的傳統，交換儀式應該是由一齣古典劇目開場？要是能在第一神殿新建好的劇場開演，一舉兩得！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#9$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請問您有什麼顧慮嗎？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦對，剛剛恩底彌翁神殿的卡珊卓拉小姐提醒我，有關第一神殿的場地借用問題，應該先與她商量……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹小姐，不必這麼麻煩。理事官辦公室的工作本來就是替忙碌的祭司們處理他們難以顧及的雜事，我會代您與她溝通的。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我原先只是擔心，第一神殿的重建由於效仿古法，管理不當，到現在還未完工，要是以此處作為交換儀式的場地，或許不太體面。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒關係，我——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除非您願意正式參與神殿的重建工作，成為負責人，那所有問題說不定都能迎刃而解。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什、什麼？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在已經到了神殿重建工程的收尾階段，比起慎重規劃，更需要的是決斷力和統籌的效率。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您跟工匠們已經相熟，之前又幫大家解決了難題，想必已經聽說了各個工種的情況。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且我聽說您在哥倫比亞接受過最先進的博物館學教育，學習過與之相關的各門學科，其中就包括建築學。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "負責為這座神殿的建設工程收尾，讓它能夠正式對外開放，應該沒有什麼問題吧？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我確實設計過我的博物館的新增建築，還監督了施工進度，不過博物館的規模沒有這座神殿這麼宏大……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "況且里底婭小姐，我身為薩爾貢使節直接負責第一神殿的修建工程，恐怕並不恰當吧？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您希望文物交換儀式在第一神殿進行，已經足以表明您對您帶來的這件文物以及對米諾斯文化有著充分的瞭解。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我十分贊成您的提議，想必向來體恤他人的卡珊卓拉小姐也不會介意。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "想不到鄰國大使竟然是這樣一位謙遜有禮的小姐。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "佩里安德洛斯？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "科林尼亞的商人之子向您問好，尊敬的薩爾貢大使，梅捷緹克緹小姐。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是里底婭理事官請來參加交換儀式的祭司代表，剛剛偶然路過，聽到您和她的談話，不禁駐足旁觀。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請容許我請教您一個問題——拋開身分不談，您是否十分樂意參與第一神殿的重建工作？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果能參與修復如此優美的米諾斯建築，不僅能學到知識，哪怕只是切割一塊大理石材，對我個人而言也是莫大的榮幸！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，為何要自尋煩惱呢？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……自尋煩惱？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我這裡有個小小的提議，或許正適合解決當下的問題。兩位小姐在內心深處其實已經一拍即合，只是礙於立場問題，無法達成共識。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹小姐的身分確實特殊，她的顧慮情有可原；而里底婭理事官需要一位既有能力又能服眾的負責人，加快神殿建設。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我們為什麼不乾脆向米諾斯流傳最久的解惑之法尋求幫助呢？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的意思是……", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "投票法。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我建議你們在第一神殿廣場設立公投，把選擇權交給參與重建的雅賽努斯人，看大家是否接受梅捷緹克緹小姐上任。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": 